* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*   call !tkwrap(text, width, out)
*
*   As $tk_wrap: out is the pieces, one to a field, each ending at the last space that keeps it within width (at least 20).  A SCREEN TEXT longer than its width is cut,
*   not wrapped, so a text that may be longer than its box goes through here first.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
subroutine tkwrap(text, width, out)
$catalog !tkwrap

   call $tk_wrap(text, width, out)
   return
end

* END-CODE
